{"id": "meda-tier3-financing", "title": "Mission Local: City put MEDA in Tier 3, then advanced a $22M loan days later", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.097, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "b8bc46b95bc927b7", "words": 395, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[10]"], "text": "In the Mission District, a nonprofit called MEDA builds affordable housing.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.42, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Mission", "hoodLabel": "Mission District", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "Mission Economic Development Agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.24, 0.53, 1.36, 1.48, 2.11, 2.58, 3.08, 3.38, 3.8]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[10]"], "text": "Mission Local says it’s 53 years old, with more than 1,300 homes.", "t0": 4.54, "t1": 9.49, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Mission", "hoodLabel": "Mission District", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "Mission Economic Development Agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.66, 0.86, 1.03, 1.59, 1.84, 2.6, 2.83, 3.01, 3.19, 3.4, 3.83, 4.05, 4.31]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[0]"], "text": "It also gets City grants:", "t0": 9.61, "t1": 11.11, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City grants to MEDA", "sub": "fiscal year 2026", "chip": "$5,658,697.38"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.47, 0.68, 0.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[0]"], "text": "about 5.7 million dollars in the year that ended June 2026.", "t0": 11.11, "t1": 14.83, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City grants to MEDA", "sub": "fiscal year 2026", "chip": "$5,658,697.38"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.37, 0.66, 0.95, 1.23, 1.49, 1.79, 1.86, 1.95, 2.09, 2.24, 2.51, 2.77, 3.04]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "Mission Local reported that in October 2026, the City’s Controller put MEDA in Tier 3.", "t0": 14.95, "t1": 20.1, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Tier 3", "sub": "the City’s highest-risk category", "kicker": "as Mission Local reported"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.71, 1.11, 1.26, 1.36, 1.78, 2.01, 2.9, 3.06, 3.35, 3.88, 4.09, 4.41, 4.54, 4.81]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "Then how many days until the City moved to lend it more?", "t0": 20.22, "t1": 22.96, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Tier 3", "sub": "the City’s highest-risk category", "kicker": "as Mission Local reported"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28, 0.47, 0.7, 0.92, 1.02, 1.28, 1.49, 1.59, 1.78, 1.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "9 days.", "t0": 22.96, "t1": 23.96, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "9 days", "label": "from highest-risk to a $22.2M loan vote"}, "emph": ["9"], "wt": [0.04, 0.35]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The first finding is the letter.", "t0": 24.58, "t1": 26.2, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-19", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "9", "fromLab": "Tier 3 letter", "toLab": "committee says yes", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.36, 0.78, 1.0, 1.11]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "On October 19, Mission Local reported, the Controller listed 10 problems MEDA hadn’t fixed.", "t0": 26.32, "t1": 31.34, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-19", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "9", "fromLab": "Tier 3 letter, per Mission Local", "toLab": "committee says yes", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.56, 1.06, 1.36, 1.64, 2.43, 2.56, 3.01, 3.34, 3.61, 4.05, 4.27, 4.53]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[1]"], "text": "Tier 3 means City checkers couldn’t confirm what some of the City’s money paid for.", "t0": 31.46, "t1": 35.08, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "missing documentation for expenses billed to the City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.53, 0.75, 1.01, 1.39, 1.7, 2.12, 2.27, 2.43, 2.5, 2.6, 2.9, 3.13, 3.37]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "The second finding is an insider.", "t0": 35.3, "t1": 37.14, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Unauthorized vendors", "sub": "set up by a former employee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Invoices", "sub": "for IT purchases"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Who approved them?", "sub": "duties not separated"}], "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 0.78, 0.92, 1.03]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "Mission Local reported the audit found a former employee allegedly set up vendors without permission,", "t0": 37.26, "t1": 43.06, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Unauthorized vendors", "sub": "set up by a former employee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Invoices", "sub": "for IT purchases"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Who approved them?", "sub": "duties not separated"}], "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 1.32, 1.75, 1.87, 2.18, 2.45, 2.55, 2.84, 3.33, 3.83, 4.02, 4.16, 4.5, 4.78]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Controller’s letter, as quoted, called it self-dealing.", "t0": 43.06, "t1": 46.28, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Unauthorized vendors", "sub": "set up by a former employee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Invoices", "sub": "for IT purchases"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Who approved them?", "sub": "duties not separated"}], "kicker": "The second finding"}, "emph": ["self-dealing"], "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.69, 1.17, 1.37, 2.13, 2.4, 2.53]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[3]"], "text": "How could one person do that? The same person could create a vendor and help pay it.", "t0": 46.4, "t1": 50.22, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "segregation of duties was insufficient"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.32, 0.47, 0.8, 0.94, 1.71, 1.89, 2.13, 2.44, 2.59, 2.85, 2.92, 3.2, 3.3, 3.48, 3.71]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["established[4]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "How much money? Mission Local reported neither document gives an amount. Or when, or who.", "t0": 50.34, "t1": 55.9, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["How much money", "When", "Who the employee is"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.38, 1.36, 1.72, 2.03, 2.48, 2.76, 3.17, 3.4, 3.48, 4.33, 4.54, 5.06, 5.26]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "The third finding is the loan.", "t0": 56.12, "t1": 57.47, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "2059-2065 Mission Street", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "an apartment building"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.39, 0.74, 0.86, 0.97]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "At the same time, MEDA asked the City to finance an apartment building on Mission Street. How much?", "t0": 57.59, "t1": 63.14, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "2059-2065 Mission Street", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "an apartment building"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.26, 0.49, 1.18, 1.52, 1.78, 1.91, 2.18, 2.32, 2.71, 2.8, 3.18, 3.46, 3.55, 3.83, 4.58, 4.79]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "amount", "established[5]"], "text": "Up to 22.2 million dollars.", "t0": 63.14, "t1": 65.19, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$22.2 million", "label": "up to, in City financing", "sub": "$18,037,500 Small Sites + $4,120,000 seismic"}, "emph": ["Up"], "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.32, 0.83, 1.07, 1.27, 1.59]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "How would that work?", "t0": 65.71, "t1": 66.94, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Housing Accelerator Fund", "sub": "holds a $20.3 million loan"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "buys that loan"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "MEDA’s building", "sub": "the City becomes the lender"}], "kicker": "How the deal works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.29, 0.46]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The City would buy MEDA’s existing 20.3 million dollar loan from the Housing Accelerator Fund.", "t0": 66.94, "t1": 71.58, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Housing Accelerator Fund", "sub": "holds a $20.3 million loan"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "buys that loan"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "MEDA’s building", "sub": "the City becomes the lender"}], "kicker": "How the deal works"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.47, 0.63, 0.83, 1.16, 1.6, 1.93, 2.16, 2.37, 2.65, 2.91, 3.16, 3.31, 3.42, 3.75, 4.3]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "So the City becomes the lender.", "t0": 71.7, "t1": 73.11, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Housing Accelerator Fund", "sub": "holds a $20.3 million loan"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "buys that loan"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "MEDA’s building", "sub": "the City becomes the lender"}], "kicker": "How the deal works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.33, 0.57, 0.92, 1.04]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "On October 21, supervisors postponed the vote when the Controller’s concerns came out.", "t0": 73.23, "t1": 78.18, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-21", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "7", "fromLab": "vote postponed", "toLab": "committee recommends", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 1.51, 2.14, 2.61, 2.71, 3.09, 3.31, 3.41, 3.84, 4.26, 4.45]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "A week later, on October 28, the Budget and Finance Committee said yes.", "t0": 78.3, "t1": 82.35, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-21", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "7", "fromLab": "vote postponed", "toLab": "committee recommends", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.33, 0.67, 0.82, 1.17, 2.11, 2.24, 2.59, 2.74, 3.11, 3.42, 3.61]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "On November 3, the full Board adopted it.", "t0": 82.47, "t1": 84.69, "shot": "b12a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Adopted, November 3, 2026", "kicker": "The full Board", "sub": "file 261107, then to the Mayors Office"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.47, 1.01, 1.17, 1.4, 1.62, 2.03]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[7]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Mission Local reported a housing official admitted supervisors weren’t always told about problems like this.", "t0": 84.81, "t1": 90.43, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "had not been consistent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.66, 1.05, 1.13, 1.47, 2.18, 2.73, 3.39, 3.67, 3.96, 4.21, 4.42, 4.87, 5.06]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[12]"], "text": "One more piece is a lead from news reports.", "t0": 90.65, "t1": 92.58, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Years of warnings", "kicker": "A lead, from news reports", "sub": "material weaknesses, per Mission Local"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.33, 0.59, 0.72, 0.79, 1.02, 1.19, 1.4]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[12]"], "text": "Mission Local reported MEDA’s auditors warned of", "t0": 92.7, "t1": 95.01, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Years of warnings", "kicker": "A lead, from news reports", "sub": "material weaknesses, per Mission Local"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.68, 1.12, 1.43, 1.87, 2.23]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[12]"], "text": "serious accounting gaps every year from 2021 to 2024.", "t0": 95.01, "t1": 98.83, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Years of warnings", "kicker": "A lead, from news reports", "sub": "material weaknesses, per Mission Local"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.43, 0.83, 1.16, 1.43, 1.61, 1.8, 2.32, 2.88, 2.99, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[13]", "suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "The federal audit record shows one for 2021, 2023, 2024 and 2025.", "t0": 98.95, "t1": 105.76, "shot": "b28f", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Federal audit clearinghouse: material weakness disclosed", "rows": [["2021", "yes"], ["2022", "none"], ["2023", "yes"], ["2024", "yes"], ["2025", "yes"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.72, 1.04, 1.4, 1.74, 1.92, 2.23, 3.19, 3.48, 4.39, 4.74, 5.64, 5.83, 6.12]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[13]", "suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "None for 2022.", "t0": 105.88, "t1": 107.09, "shot": "b28f", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Federal audit clearinghouse: material weakness disclosed", "rows": [["2021", "yes"], ["2022", "none"], ["2023", "yes"], ["2024", "yes"], ["2025", "yes"]]}, "emph": ["None for 2022"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.35, 0.61]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[12]"], "text": "Yet in 2025, the City approved a refinancing. How big?", "t0": 107.21, "t1": 111.14, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Years of warnings", "kicker": "A lead, from news reports", "sub": "material weaknesses, per Mission Local"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.26, 0.52, 1.09, 1.22, 1.45, 1.78, 1.86, 3.02, 3.26]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[12]"], "text": "37.8 million dollars.", "t0": 111.14, "t1": 113.2, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$37.8 million", "label": "refinancing of 15 MEDA sites, 2025", "sub": "file 251009, October 2025"}, "emph": ["37.8"], "wt": [0.04, 0.65, 0.9, 1.1, 1.39]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "story[4]"], "text": "MEDA says an outside auditor found no unauthorized costs charged to grants,", "t0": 113.82, "t1": 117.74, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any City grant money was misused", "Whether the Mayor signed the financing resolution"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.6, 0.73, 1.14, 1.52, 1.73, 1.91, 2.5, 2.84, 3.14, 3.26]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "story[4]"], "text": "and that it has fixed the concerns.", "t0": 117.74, "t1": 119.34, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any City grant money was misused", "Whether the Mayor signed the financing resolution"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.35, 0.45, 0.62, 0.9, 0.99]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? The full Controller letter, and the signed resolution and loan documents.", "t0": 119.46, "t1": 123.98, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The full Tier 3 letter"}, {"who": "", "what": "The signed resolution and final loan documents"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.35, 0.67, 0.93, 1.1, 1.32, 1.79, 2.16, 2.34, 2.44, 2.73, 3.29, 3.47, 3.71]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "No charge is on record. The amount involved is still unknown.", "t0": 124.1, "t1": 127.12, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.57, 0.69, 0.83, 1.46, 1.62, 1.89, 2.29, 2.39, 2.65]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.24, "t1": 129.41, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.66, 0.86, 1.16, 1.26, 1.36, 1.6, 1.83]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "find1": "Finding 1 · Tier 3", "find2": "Finding 2 · self-dealing", "find3": "Finding 3 · $22.2 million", "lead": "A lead · years of warnings", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "map", "hook": "contrast"}